  "description": "After one declared failure, cleanup empties the complete declared residue population. A distinct complete protected-resource population is observed through the same bound population identity before failure and after settlement; both complete state populations have the protected-resource cardinality and the after-state population equals the before-state population. A separately selected authority, distinct from the failed attempt's authority, has equal state before and after settlement, is preserved by cleanup, later authorizes a valid attempt, and that attempt returns the expected successful result.",
